.diagrams/

# ── Desktop build artefacts ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Tauri target dir, Cargo lockfile is committed (Cargo.lock) but build
# outputs are not. The sidecar bundle is regenerated on every release; do
# not commit the 400 MB output.
desktop/src-tauri/target/
desktop/src-tauri/gen/
desktop/sidecar-bundle/

